  "description": "A revered war hero, Commander Li Xiao leaves the battlefield to become the Director of the Government General. On his first day of the job, he meets Hwa-Su, a high class male escort, in action. Hwa-Su seems to recognize Li Xiao from before but Li Xiao simply thinks of Hwa-Su as a disgrace to mankind for being a male escort spreading his legs for the same sex. However, by a twist of fate, Li Xiao finds himself being drawn to him...\n\n(Source: POCKET COMICS)",
